#   canvas_paintable - Painting::CanvasPaintable: the paintable of a <canvas>
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/Painting/CanvasPaintable.cpp (lines 1-50) and CanvasPaintable.h:
#       creation, and painting the canvas's surface (presented to its external content
#       source) with its rounded corners.
